@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFC
  BorderColor #36566F
  StartColor #36566F
  EndColor #36566F
}

title OctaPoint - settlementStatus

[*] --> PENDING : outbox event committed
PENDING --> PROCESSING : worker claims eligible event
PROCESSING --> SETTLED : Sui confirms; digest persisted
PROCESSING --> PENDING : retryable failure\nschedule backoff
PROCESSING --> FAILED : permanent failure or retry limit reached
FAILED --> PENDING : Admin retries after resolution

note right of FAILED
  No automatic retry.
  Blocks the customer queue: later events for the same
  tenant/customer cannot be claimed until manual resolution.
  Other customers may continue.
end note

note right of SETTLED
  Terminal state.
  Business ledger remains append-only.
end note
@enduml
